# Docs

Written record for the line, from the idea through the methods. A paper's locked claim stays in `papers/<slug>/notes/claims.md`. The one-paragraph program aim stays in the repository README.

| Stage | Path | What it holds |
|:------|:-----|:--------------|
| Idea | `design.md` | Question, population, measures, and endpoints as planned |
| Application | `funding/` | Scientific pages that were submitted |
| Methods | `methods/` | Procedures, questionnaire templates, dictionary, analysis plan |

Quote `papers/<slug>/notes/claims.md` for a paper. Quote a dated file in `funding/` for what a sponsor was told. Quote the file in `methods/` that the claim names for a procedure or a planned estimate. When those disagree, leave both as written.

Do not add `aims.md` in this directory. Do not run `symkit` with `--docs`.
